 "final_prompt": "I want to make a lemon garlic chicken with roasted potatoes tonight. I already have salt, olive oil, and oregano at home. Give me a shopping list of only the ingredients I still need to buy: chicken, lemons, garlic, and potatoes. Put one item per line, four lines total, and don't include any cooking steps.\n\n<document>\nWeeknight lemon chicken (serves 4)\n\nIngredients\n4 chicken thighs\n2 lemons\n3 cloves garlic\n1 tbsp olive oil\n1 tsp dried oregano\n1 lb baby potatoes\nsalt\n\nSteps\n1. Preheat the oven to 425°F.\n2. Toss the potatoes with the olive oil and salt.\n3. Rub the chicken with garlic, oregano and lemon zest.\n4. Roast everything for 35 minutes, squeeze the lemons over the top, and serve.\n</document>",
